    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>soul Interface</i> is an evolution simulator / sandbox with functioning natural selection and space multiplayer. It provides multiple playstyles depending on which you prefer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Involved - </strong>You get to design organisms with soft bodies made of individual atoms and brains made up of neurons and neural networks. You program or train their behaviors to outeat, outgrow or hunt into extinction competing lifeforms. Eventually, you get to send out your most invasive organsims and duel with other players, trying to overtake their ecosystems with your species\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill -</strong> You are tasked with growing and maintaining a virtual aquarium.<br>You will create safe, warm currents to grow digital jellyfish; architect growbeds for virtual seaweed; or safe hunting grounds for baby sharks. Select species of plants and predators that coexist well together\u2026 and watch your digital ecosystem flourish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this wrapped in hand-programmed vector graphics, from an alternate reality 2000s. The game features full voiceacting and an atmospheric music score by our amazing composer, Geoffrey Guyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Join our <strong>Discord</strong> to participate in development and ex[erimentation; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Check our <strong>YouTube</strong> for <strong>instructional videos</strong> if you want to try AI-training.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>soul Interface</i> is an evolution simulator / sandbox with functioning natural selection and space multiplayer. It provides multiple playstyles depending on which you prefer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Involved - </strong>You get to design organisms with soft bodies made of individual atoms and brains made up of neurons and neural networks. You program or train their behaviors to outeat, outgrow or hunt into extinction competing lifeforms. Eventually, you get to send out your most invasive organsims and duel with other players, trying to overtake their ecosystems with your species\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill -</strong> You are tasked with growing and maintaining a virtual aquarium.<br>You will create safe, warm currents to grow digital jellyfish; architect growbeds for virtual seaweed; or safe hunting grounds for baby sharks. Select species of plants and predators that coexist well together\u2026 and watch your digital ecosystem flourish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this wrapped in hand-programmed vector graphics, from an alternate reality 2000s. The game features full voiceacting and an atmospheric music score by our amazing composer, Geoffrey Guyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Join our <strong>Discord</strong> to participate in development and ex[erimentation; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Check our <strong>YouTube</strong> for <strong>instructional videos</strong> if you want to try AI-training.</p>",
